<p>Hi <%= @appointment.patient.name.presence || @appointment.patient.email %>,</p>

<p>
  Unfortunately, your appointment
  <% if @appointment.staff.present? %>
    with <%= @appointment.staff.name.presence || @appointment.staff.email %>
  <% end %>
  has had to be cancelled because they've become unavailable:
</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Clinic:</strong> <%= @clinic.name %></li>
  <li><strong>Service:</strong> <%= @service.name %></li>
  <li><strong>Was scheduled for:</strong> <%= @appointment.starts_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p") %></li>
  <% if @clinic.address.present? %>
    <li><strong>Address:</strong> <%= @clinic.address %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>We're sorry for the inconvenience. Please <%= link_to "book a new time", clinic_booking_url(@clinic) %> at your convenience.</p>
